===Etymology===
<div>{{bor+|fr|LL.|alphabētum}}, from {{der|fr|grc|ἀλφάβητος}}, from {{m|grc|ἄλφα}} (Α,α) and {{m|grc|βῆτα}} (Β,β) (the first two letters of the [[Greek alphabet]]), from {{der|fr|phn|aleph}} {{m|phn|𐤀||ox}} and {{m|en|beth}} {{m|phn|𐤁||house}}, so called because they were pictograms of those objects, having developed from the Egyptian hieroglyphs <hiero>F1</hiero> ({{m|egy|𓃾}}) and <hiero>pr</hiero> ({{m|egy|𓉐}}).</div>

